1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
In life, we should never be too quick to cast blame on others.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Every person who crosses our path plays a role in shaping who we become.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
The good people, they bring joy, warmth, and happiness.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,000
They remind us of the beauty and connection and the comfort of being understood.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:24,000
The bad ones, they offer something just as valuable, experience.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,000
From them, we learn caution, resilience, and how to stand back up after being knocked down.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
The worst people come with the toughest challenges.

8
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:37,000
They test our patience, our values, and sometimes even our strength.

9
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:42,000
But in the end, they leave behind lessons that stay with us for a lifetime.

10
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:46,000
And then, there are the best people, the rare ones.

11
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,000
They leave footprints on our hearts, not because they were perfect,

12
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,000
but because they gave us moments worth remembering forever.

13
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:57,000
So instead of blaming anyone, be grateful for them all.

14
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Because each of them contributes a unique chapter to the story of your life.

